    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, one potential risk is that the client requires an AI assistance solution for hospital staff that must improve efficiency of staff and quality and safety of care to be implemented at a large hospital with 4500 staff and 1200 beds, which may pose scalability challenges." ;
