    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To mitigate these risks and capitalize on opportunities, our company's can leverage our company's hybrid delivery model, combining agile iterations with a phase-gate structure, to ensure flexibility and adaptability throughout the project. our company's dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, can work closely with the client to understand the client specific needs and tailor our company's solution accordingly. our company's governance practices, including a joint steering committee and operational committee, can facilitate effective communication and collaboration with the client. our company's must also ensure that our company's bid response clearly outlines how our company's will address the client requirements, including data sovereignty, security, and compliance with regulatory constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By emphasizing our company's relevant past experiences, highlighting the adaptability of our company's our flagship product, Atelier platform, and demonstrating a thorough understanding of the client needs and constraints, our company's can submit a coherent and compliant bid response that showcases our consortium strengths and capabilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires an AI solution that must integrate with existing staff processes, hospital information system (SIH), electronic patient record (DPI), and user directories. an AI solution that must integrate with existing staff processes, hospital information system (SIH), electronic patient record (DPI), and user directories must provide API-type interfaces, guarantee quick access to reliable up-to-date information, and achieve a high level of answer relevance. an AI solution that must integrate with existing staff processes, hospital information system (SIH), electronic patient record (DPI), and user directories must also comply with health interoperability standards such as HL7, FHIR, national health identifier (INS), and the national framework Ségur du numérique en santé Mon Espace Santé DMP." ;
