    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on our company context, our can address several client requirements. our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform, can integrate with existing staff processes and provide API-type interfaces through Our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform API-first design (REST + webhook)." ;
