    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To propose a compliant technical architecture, our should focus on the following key elements:  1. **Integration**: Leverage our API-first approach and existing connectors (e.g., FHIR_HL7) to integrate with SIH, DPI, and user directories. 2. **Performance and Scalability**: Ensure Our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) platform can scale to meet the client's performance demands, leveraging our horizontal scaling capabilities. 3. **Interoperability Standards Compliance**: Highlight our compliance with HL7, FHIR, INS, and Ségur du numérique en santé Mon Espace Santé DMP frameworks. 4. **Data Sovereignty and Security**: Emphasize our sovereign hosting options, including the SecNumCloud-qualified HDS tier on OuraneCloud, to address data protection and regulatory compliance concerns. 5. **Explainability and Transparency**: Showcase how our RAG platform's provides explainable recommendations, supporting audit trails and source grounding as required by healthcare regulations." ;
