    <http://example.org/node/chunk171> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As a CSR & Sustainability officer at our company's, I can highlight several aspects from our company's company context that demonstrate our company's commitment to reducing energy consumption, relying on low-carbon infrastructure, and minimizing environmental footprint." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk172> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Firstly, our company's EcoVadis rating of Silver indicates a strong commitment to corporate social responsibility, which includes environmental sustainability. our company's have conducted a bilan carbone, covering scopes 1, 2, and main scope 3 items, including cloud inference, showcasing our company's proactive approach to understanding and managing our company's carbon footprint. our company's partnership with green hosting providers like OuraneCloud in the EU, who utilize renewable energy and achieve a PUE of 1.2, demonstrates our company's dedication to low-carbon infrastructure." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk173> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, OuraneCloud in the EU, who utilize renewable energy and achieve a PUE of 1.2 practice of heat reuse further reduces waste and enhances energy efficiency." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk174> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of digital sobriety practices, our company's implement model right-sizing, caching, and batching. model right-sizing, caching, and batching not only contribute to reducing our company's energy consumption but also enhance the efficiency of our company's operations, aligning with the client's expectations for environmental responsibility. our company's social commitments, including being a signatory to the responsible tech charter and having gender balance and inclusion objectives, show that our company's value broader societal impacts, which can include environmental stewardship." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk175> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The AI ethics principles our company's've published, emphasizing human oversight, transparency, bias monitoring, data minimization, and documented data-use policy, while primarily focused on ethical AI use, also indirectly support environmental sustainability by promoting efficient and responsible technology use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk176> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given these strengths, our company's can propose a solution that highlights our company's existing commitment to environmental sustainability. our company's should emphasize our company's ability to provide carbon reporting capabilities, ensuring transparency in the environmental impact of our company's solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk177> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By leveraging our company's green hosting partnerships and digital sobriety practices, our company's can demonstrate how our company's infrastructure and operational practices align with the client's goals for reducing energy consumption and relying on low-carbon solutions." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk178> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It's also crucial to address known sustainability trade-offs, such as the balance between high availability and energy consumption. our company's should be prepared to discuss how our company's solution navigates these complexities, potentially offering options that allow clients to make informed decisions about clients priorities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk179> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In conclusion, by emphasizing our company's EcoVadis rating, green hosting partnerships, digital sobriety practices, social commitments, AI ethics principles, and carbon reporting capabilities, our company's can demonstrate a strong commitment to environmental sustainability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message15> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk18> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must facilitate the continuity of care between professionals and services by enabling relevant information sharing, an understanding of the context of an in-progress patient pathway, and an efficient resumption of handling by another professional. 4." ;
