    <http://example.org/node/chunk181> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium is pleased to submit a proposal for the artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB). the artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) aims to improve the efficiency of staff and quality and safety of care delivered to patients, while ensuring strict compliance with regulatory requirements, including GDPR, medical confidentiality, and sovereignty constraints." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk182> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium AI solution, Atelier, is designed to assist hospital staff in hospital staff daily activities, providing quick access to reliable and up-to-date information, and supporting clinical and administrative tasks." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk183> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our AI solution, Atelier, integrates with the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) existing information systems, including the hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), and supports health interoperability standards such as HL7, FHIR, and the national framework Ségur du Numérique en Santé. the artificial intelligence (AI) assistance solution for hospital staff at the Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) is based on a retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) approach, which enables the generation of answers grounded in the organization's own validated documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk184> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our AI solution, Atelier, provides drafting assistance for clinical and administrative content, including discharge summaries, medical reports, and patient letters, and supports medical coding (PMSI, ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk185> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our AI solution, Atelier, ensure that Our AI solution, Atelier, solution is designed to be explainable and transparent, providing a high level of answer relevance and response times compatible with daily clinical use." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk186> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our AI solution, Atelier, solution also ensures the continuity of care between professionals and services, and supports collaboration and communication among healthcare teams." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk187> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our consortium has experience in implementing AI solutions in healthcare settings and has a strong track record of delivering successful projects." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

